OL,3,AWhat we know about stabbing on Flydubai
OL,4,Aflight to Israel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv was
OL,7,Fdiverted to Saudi Arabia on Wednesday
OL,8,Fafter one pilot stabbed the other and
OL,9,F"apparently tried to crash the plane",
OL,10,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,11,FNetanyahu has said.
OL,13,FThe pilot was arrested and is being
OL,14,Fquestioned by Saudi authorities,
OL,15,FNetanyahu added.
OL,17,FThe stabbed pilot, identified as Indian
OL,18,Fnational Capt Smit Machchhar, was taken
OL,19,Fto hospital after the flight landed and
OL,20,Flater called a "hero" by the Israeli
OL,21,Fprime minister.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
