OL,3,AWhat we know about stabbing on Flydubai
OL,4,Aflight to Israel
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli Defence Minister Israel Katz
OL,7,Fhas called the incident an "attempted
OL,8,Fjihadist terror attack". The BBC is yet
OL,9,Fto receive official statements from
OL,10,Fpolice, emergency services, or
OL,11,Finvestigators regarding any motive.
